!-----------------------------------------------------------------------
!
! Absorption cross-section CHF2Cl (HCFC22): CHF2Cl + hv --> Cl
! source : JPL-2006 (no change with respect to JPL-2002)
! http://www.atmosphere.mpg.de/enid/2295
! -> Catalogue -> "Halogeno-alkanes, -alkyl radicals" -> "Freons-HCFC(C,H,F,Cl)" 
!           -> "CHF2Cl(HCFC-22)" -> "JPL-2002"
! Rem1: Quantum yield = 1.
! Rem2: Temperature influence:
!   i)  170-174nm: T ind.
!   ii) 174-204nm: T dep. according to the formula (Gillotay & Simon, 1988):
!           log10 crs = sum An*wl^n + (T-273)*sum Bn*wl^n
!       where An and Bn are parameters introduced in CRS_CFC.
!       The cross sections are computed in subroutine CRS_TDEP. 
!       Accordingly, data (174-204nm) given below are not used.
! Rem3: JPL-2006 reports crs for wl > 204nm at room temperature (295-298K) without
!       mentioning their temperature dependence. These values have been obtained
!       by extrapolation of the data "174-204nm", but JPL-2006 does not point out
!       whether the polynomial formula is still available for the wl range.
!		We assume it is the case and then have extended the validity of the T-dep. formula
!		to the range [174-219.8nm].
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Begins at wl interval :        44  | Finishes at wl interval :   68
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!  no  from(nm) to(nm)  | crs (cm2) | qyield (0->1) |   Tdep_param1 |   Tdep_param2
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  44   172.40   173.90     7.45E-20           1.000
  45   173.90   175.40     5.18E-20           1.000
  46   175.40   177.00     3.93E-20           1.000
  47   177.00   178.60     2.91E-20           1.000
  48   178.60   180.20     2.17E-20           1.000
  49   180.20   181.80     1.59E-20           1.000
  50   181.80   183.50     1.14E-20           1.000
  51   183.50   185.20     8.02E-21           1.000
  52   185.20   186.90     5.77E-21           1.000
  53   186.90   188.70     3.98E-21           1.000
  54   188.70   190.50     2.72E-21           1.000
  55   190.50   192.30     1.83E-21           1.000
  56   192.30   194.20     1.23E-21           1.000
  57   194.20   196.10     8.52E-22           1.000
  58   196.10   198.00     5.94E-22           1.000
  59   198.00   200.00     4.00E-22           1.000
  60   200.00   202.00     2.70E-22           1.000
  61   202.00   204.10     1.79E-22           1.000
  62   204.10   206.20     1.09E-22           1.000
